msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:49
#: bfbef4ab051d446ab2e508242ba98a3d
msgid ""
"The appendix uses the reference implementation's HTTP surface, exposed in"
" `reference-impl/code-kg/handlers.go` (all endpoints are under `/api/v1"
"/code-kg`). `curl` against the running server is the reproducible path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:54
#: 04a634dc451747508ad6f19a531abc05
msgid "The walkthrough assumes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:56
#: 9f2b06b893cb4589aa82341229a46367
msgid ""
"A checkout of any Go repository you want to index at `~/reference-impl"
"/code-kg` (substitute your own path throughout if your clone lives "
"elsewhere), with the code-layer server built once via `make build`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:60
#: ea7b30bab02f459eb4241967bf922d1c
msgid ""
"A graph database accessible via the Bolt protocol on "
"`bolt://localhost:7687` (e.g. `docker run --rm -p 7687:7687 "
"memgraph/memgraph:latest`). If you skip this, graph writes become no-ops "
"— the rest of the pipeline still runs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:65
#: 3a1246c6c41f41b7b28804a5d02008fe
msgid ""
"**Optional** `LLM_API_KEY` / `EMBEDDING_API_KEY` environment variables. "
"Without them, the enricher degrades to \"unavailable\" and retrieval "
"falls back to keyword-only (Chapter 12, Tier 2), which is enough to "
"demonstrate the full pipeline."
msgstr ""

