#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:355
#: f6c6c3cc16a84319b074d66774009775
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../appendix-b-example-code-kg/index.md:357
#: 3799139bae274329a6c437b0b7a997c5
msgid ""
"This appendix is the working proof that the five pipeline stages "
"described in Chapters 9 – 13 compose into a KB you can query in roughly "
"ten HTTP calls. It also exposes the operational surface Part IV (Chapter "
"14 in particular) needs to tame: the full-sync wall clock, the "
"incremental-sync speedup ratio, and the identity churn that only "
"manifests on a line-number change. With both appendices in hand, a reader"
" has end-to-end reproductions of the prose (Part II) and code (Part III) "
"stacks in under twenty commands each."
msgstr ""

